## StartStreaming
D geometry
H begin
D prepare rate=48000 cap=1[1] play=1[0]
H reserve playback allowed=ffffffffffffffff bw=308 -> ch=0
H reserve capture allowed=ffffffffffffffff bw=308 !0xe00002be
D break connections
D disconnect playback
H stop tx
D disconnect capture
H stop rx
H stop all
## -> 0xe00002be streaming=0
